{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "9a78503881d9661698392c7f11f7ecb7c6c8291883ae1a7b485ea4fbe6314c9d", "ja": "敵を知り、己を知れば", "zh": "知己知彼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d1356e31804d2324fedaa8a559319c815a524718d929d0cdfc01d745b1da3c5d", "ja": "準備が進む中、プロデューサーと作戦会議を\nした美也は、美希の撮影の見学を依頼する。\n見学後、美希との違いを感じて少し落ち込む\n美也だったが、美希は正面から来た美也を\n褒め、お互い良い勝負にしようと話す。", "zh": "随着准备工作逐步推进，美也与制作人\n开了作战会议，并请求参观美希的拍摄。\n参观结束后，美也感受到了自己与美希的差距，\n有些消沉，而美希却夸奖了直面而来的美也，\n并表示要让这场较量成为一场精彩的对决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "37247d89174134d666e426927e0b8656f935162e5a0d4799f4e63d08d9c9309e", "ja": "（衣装が決まり、イベントの準備は順調に進んでいる。\nそれにしても、莉緒のあの反応は意外だったな……）", "zh": "（服装定下来了，活动的准备工作也进行得很顺利。话说回来，莉绪当时的反应还真是出乎意料……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "24bccdacda40ebc399aa9b888838a26472613927cb6d66a7f007838c4eba0ba8", "ja": "（とはいえ、これは真剣勝負だ。それぞれの魅力を\n最大限に発揮して、頑張ってもらわないと……ん？）", "zh": "（话虽如此，这可是一次真刀真枪的较量。得让她们充分发挥各自的魅力，好好加油才行……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "e00bffc1c83856af69483ae506e7494488ba3979be94c035c9375ede8d3cffdc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\n今、ちょっといいですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～。\n现在方便打扰一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ecc575c50bf61070f176c38b1847c9ec100e50f4ad1d9796d069e7e959274bfb", "ja": "お疲れ様、美也。\nいいけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，美也。\n可以啊，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "a667666036c90a5351a221ca26f2c716d23fe64d44bf94ef14f1a71f23199034", "ja": "もしお時間があったら、作戦会議に\n付き合ってもらえないかと思いまして～。", "zh": "如果您有时间的话，不知道能不能陪我开个作战会议呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "156c5a1c0b9a04ae402dd513f8a6a938bd7ecf68e9611c76c9dc652c3046eb32", "ja": "作戦会議？", "zh": "作战会议？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "1878fb5de0f06d8b97c921c569cbeb438ba981ae46c270a4797b6d335a81264d", "ja": "はい～。昨日の莉緒さん、可愛いかったですね～。\nジュリアちゃんも、とっても似合ってました～。", "zh": "是的～昨天的莉绪小姐，真可爱呢～  \n茱莉亚也非常适合呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "bab127ca7bb6ec69166a65362d6bb3604f0116a009d25eb8615de28654bda8ed", "ja": "でも、勝負となると……\nやっぱり美希ちゃんが手強そうですな～。", "zh": "不过，要是比起胜负来……\n\n果然还是美希最难对付呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7a16afb898426313f991e19652083021261d40d81d3786e4e66ba50d43a8f480", "ja": "美希か……確かに前回のJCCも出演してるし、\nファッションが好きだからな。", "zh": "美希啊……确实，她还出演过上次的JCC，而且喜欢时尚嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "ed3950a52271d5ecbaae726b759f00bccbb287a0f41c35ee729423292d7ae858", "ja": "美希ちゃんとは、同じANGEL STARSなので。\n協力するというのも手なのですが～……。", "zh": "因为美希酱和我是同一个ANGEL STARS的成员。\n互相合作也是个办法，不过～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "043e8380f3f67dda5e17428e177fc93df1ed28b58d77e50e0bfe4baa389137ee", "ja": "最初からそれは、弱気かと思ったので～。\n勝負なら強気、攻め気でいきたいです～。", "zh": "我觉得一开始就那样想的话，未免太没底气了～。\n既然是比赛，就想强势出击、主动进攻～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ef300a85206f8c1e5f5ab79a866288e082a443a27df957486d40d206cf50ccac", "ja": "おお……！　うん、いい姿勢だと思うよ。", "zh": "哦……！嗯，我觉得这是个不错的态度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "adfbf238194c402b82618a6f4175f0287c56b65a9eba3794f0b5ddbb99ba3abb", "ja": "そこで、{$P$}さんに\n一つお願いがありまして～……あ。", "zh": "所以，我有一个请求想拜托{$P$}先生～……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "56a9e24d35055f59603b9996890572f3e1031fe0fb328f3cb3b3eada08dd8e31", "ja": "でも私だけ、こんな風にお願いするのは\nズルになるでしょうか～？　む～ん……。", "zh": "不过只有我这样拜托，会不会算是耍赖呢～？　唔～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1271a4741532f005f20f78748fae1ece52306fe4fde835923679e839733914dd", "ja": "いや、みんなが全力を出せるようにサポートするのが\nプロデューサーの仕事だから。大丈夫だ。", "zh": "不会，让大家能够全力以赴做好支持工作，\n本就是制作人的职责。没事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "c4bb3053caabeab16cf55e32c64605331c75e61d3142d6fc6cf343e687e58f1e", "ja": "そうですか、それならよかったです～。\nではお言葉に甘えて……。", "zh": "这样啊，那就太好了～  \n那我就恭敬不如从命了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "78497b50d45fd9ea4a5a2ea8e050ec9d3965a10bff28620065e45797b0391350", "ja": "私、美希ちゃんのお仕事の、見学に行きたいんです～。\n連れて行ってください～。", "zh": "我想去参观一下美希的工作现场～。\n请带我去嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6236132f7bd0036d1decdfbc3d2cae38422934330951058358902f7e1825fa12", "ja": "美希の仕事を、見学？", "zh": "要去参观美希的工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "f1914c5365c63e236332fd482909a08d7bb795f51f52481e2dc6598ce4f9165c", "ja": "まずは敵情視察かと～。敵を知り己を知れば、\n百戦危うからずですよ～。むふふ♪", "zh": "首先去刺探敌情～所谓知己知彼，\n才能百战不殆嘛～。呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1019_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d9f89deffbb78f1b0901e47eb3decac0d99bc6b62f816d81500a1c213bbb87bd", "ja": "……というわけで、美也が美希の仕事を\n見学したいそうなんだ。問題ないか？", "zh": "……事情就是这样，美也说想来观摩\n美希的工作。你这边方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "faca8a7b56f0bc1b24d0f630882d5308e41f2df160b4a2e52f74e6d9df437bcb", "ja": "うん、いいよ。\n美也の参考になるかは、わからないけど。", "zh": "嗯，好呀。\n虽然不知道能不能给美也当参考就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "a5ad9b43353cf298d7763b9722230a41b9940cb771e4a0dc1c6d7f8c188ffde3", "ja": "ありがとうございます、美希ちゃん。\n邪魔はしませんので、よろしくお願いしますね～。", "zh": "谢谢你，美希。\n我不会打扰你的，那就拜托你啰～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1023_camman", "source_sha256": "171782d0fe692ae097abf45a2f708d4b4701e0a45f8acc34ef70bbe52eb31ebb", "ja": "美希ちゃーん！\nそろそろ撮影のほう始めましょうか！", "zh": "美希——！差不多该开始拍摄了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "399e25549f5af16de8dd5dd013b1fb69ac3a75f3ec3509436f8e63661e96af6c", "ja": "はーいなの。\nそれじゃ、行ってくるね。", "zh": "好～的。\n那美希去喽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1025_camman", "source_sha256": "d79c2dee6f79f2fcd690cefa1828eb54948f410ed545a17ec9f5eb518fd4596c", "ja": "最初は……自信に満ち溢れた感じがほしいな！\nそこからニュアンスつけてこっか！", "zh": "一开始……想要那种充满自信的感觉！\n从那里再慢慢加上细微的变化吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "6114c080d9b05533848e944a5b50842c96ed175be02fee503ba45fa1e19974bf", "ja": "えっと、最初はこんな感じで……\nあとこういうのとか、こういうの？", "zh": "那个，最开始先这样……\n还有这种的，或者这种的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1027_camman", "source_sha256": "3b9aa655e6c13ff3dcc5bbc0519c56518e0dd7731294b31676c311d6cd113c6c", "ja": "お！　その表情、ステキですね！\nそういうの欲しかったんですよ～！　流石です！", "zh": "哦！这个表情真棒！\n我想要的就是这个～！不愧是您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "05ffd0856d5647722ed9dc1b8219618767189bf2351bbdfdfe7a4335730f0505", "ja": "おお～……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1029_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "48a39278c0aa9c54537ac8694a3fa9b5094baf83d6c2db45db856817244c9c9d", "ja": "あふぅ……撮影、まだ半分なの～……。\n……ねえ、{$P$}。", "zh": "哈呜……拍摄还没到一半呢～……\n……呐，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "ce1fe7e70a6721d9a4a8c8c5890093e4c18b06a984ce71700929145a6499cf12", "ja": "今日は美也と一緒のグラビアってことにして、\n残りは美也に頑張ってもらうとかにしない？", "zh": "今天就当作是和美也一起拍写真，\n剩下的部分让美也努力完成，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "424d28ae85f0cefb2e8d9c6b7c85bc8332c1e9e65882ad7a2d348ff2de16c843", "ja": "そんな無茶な……。\nあと半分なんだから、気合いを入れて頑張ろう！", "zh": "这也太乱来了……既然还剩一半，就打起精神加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "e5c4a64c9e70f25fc093d32cd7afa39c76892ea9f820747c940383ac25726ba3", "ja": "むぅ……じゃあ、ミキがお仕事がんばったら、\nご褒美くれる？", "zh": "唔……那如果美希努力工作的话，会给美希奖励吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "1717b9aa282025fa8020d09554051e9810bbf878040e074d919392d331821341", "ja": "そうだな。今日は美也の見学もOKしてくれたし、\n帰りにスイーツでもご馳走しようか。", "zh": "是啊。今天也答应让美也来参观了，回去的时候请你吃点甜品怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "fb781cb9d1683476bf338b4f45c208e61cfcfe01120135cc4f8586b910e09985", "ja": "ホントに！？\nやったぁ♪なの！　ミキ、がんばろーっと♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n太好了♪那美希会加油的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "da6aef9768eb8736cc91f5ff917b21fffd8f968f1d6a6daeef884082604e5d2e", "ja": "あの、美希ちゃん。\n質問してもいいですか～？", "zh": "那个，美希。\n能问你一个问题吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "fd28b9339950138add93fbfbd170189ad63b02b9e4fe8901c821ecac6c53cb34", "ja": "質問？　いいよ、何？", "zh": "问题？可以啊，什么问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "cdcb08a6b7cc2d27f6e4afc6e8b83818200ce76c6c4c177fd90dc682ab1069c4", "ja": "さっきの撮影のことなんですけど……。\nどうして、してほしいことがわかったんですか～？", "zh": "是关于刚才拍摄的事……  \n你怎么知道我想让你做什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "ebdf2815730ebabc83f326536a9a6c5854075c6dfce5137ec360a96dde9e740e", "ja": "美希ちゃん、カメラマンさんが何か言う前に、\n自分から動いていたので……気になって～。", "zh": "美希在摄影师说什么之前，就自己先行动起来了……所以有点在意～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1040_003mik", "source_sha256": "6e246f327675845713fb685b8d291424eaed0e7a2045c004b171cca315be7dce", "ja": "うーん……なんとなく？", "zh": "嗯……就是觉得应该这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "a5a92d1779bfea2823b86d04a6059a6c4452b3ef21e82b5e8f9c2f65cbaf1214", "ja": "なんと～。{$P$}さん、\nいつもこうなんですか～？", "zh": "原来如此～。{$P$}先生，\n你一直都是这样的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "c147f96300cb6d520e401f4e62bf532ffd494734eac6f5fc9c2732f4b334349e", "ja": "美希は勘がいいからな……。打てば響くというか、\nグラビア撮影なんかは、サクサク進む事が多いかな。", "zh": "美希很敏锐……该说是反应很快吧，\n像写真拍摄之类的工作，很多时候都能顺顺利利地进行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "8a6e09920d48c0bed29b0e2be84f7fa38fb903cc8cd019a66cec5afa42b2e6bf", "ja": "なるほど～……。\n……。", "zh": "原来如此～……\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1044_null", "source_sha256": "79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed", "ja": "撮影終了後……", "zh": "拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "109cf8def8f0328661e528b4ba6af35d4977493e1bd123b4849127257f9db456", "ja": "撮影はこれで終わったな。\n美也、どうだった？", "zh": "拍摄就到这里结束了。\n美也，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "afaa3731e838146f2493ea449c0a015a85a5f4b16ef84230920993faa4900d34", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。\nとっても、勉強になりましたよ～。", "zh": "谢谢您～  \n真是学到了很多呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1047_042miy", "source_sha256": "a3f21dad2a03a66fbbd8a117cf6ae7a6f139c9c373ae765c5aeef116a3d93808", "ja": "美希ちゃんはすごいですな～。私だったら、\nもっと時間が掛かっていたと思います～。", "zh": "美希真厉害啊～。换作是我，\n应该会花更多时间吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "f40f48ab2a218ee31e0675567e9f77ec02b902efd164957d4e4a5e8d44c87b0a", "ja": "横で指示を聞いても、自分ならどうするか、\nちっともわかりませんでした……。", "zh": "就算在旁边听着指示，我也完全不知道换作自己该怎么做……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "b1c2789a031ec7710b0044912e8b047f280c7cfcdbb80bada87bd03149164f6c", "ja": "美也……。", "zh": "美也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1051_042miy", "source_sha256": "474bcc22f0a1b36ee96c0e4af64c15ef255de76d1e3a8276184b8800c90b2eca", "ja": "私なりの勝機を見出すために、見学させてもらったん\nですけど。かえって、わからなくなってきましたな～。", "zh": "为了找出属于我的胜机，我来参观学习了，\n不过反而越来越搞不明白了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1052_003mik", "source_sha256": "6368a9b2ce29c12b52411c8fbb7573e50e3b9d4703575925c0ec452348730264", "ja": "……。ふふっ。\n美也って、なんか面白いの！", "zh": "……呵呵。\n美也真是个有趣的人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1053_042miy", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1054_003mik", "source_sha256": "495028dec9b026d18560045d95b23c2f75aa2efc33c923bb31a0494cccd80cc2", "ja": "だって、ミキにどうやって勝つか、\nミキの目の前で話してるんだもん。", "zh": "因为你正在美希面前说要怎么赢过美希嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1055_003mik", "source_sha256": "acf754c4b0f787dd3f63f67a791af3206b535f6c819b2a46c587d91a43a6e949", "ja": "今日のテーサツだって、正面からお願いしに来たし。\nそれって、美也の凄いところだって思うな。", "zh": "就连今天来“侦察”，也是直接跑到我面前来拜托的。  \n我觉得这就是美也厉害的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1056_042miy", "source_sha256": "af219d7dca184c5337971056e7b9556f1cce8c8b69e678add8cf36297f151ab4", "ja": "美希ちゃん……。", "zh": "美希……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1057_p", "source_sha256": "01900176b6499f70f380203618a722297336c074ce76bf25839dc854e7a87bc2", "ja": "そうだな。当然のように、正々堂々と勝負を挑む。\n美也のいいところだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。像这样堂堂正正地发起挑战，\n我觉得正是美也的优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1058_003mik", "source_sha256": "2608986a40b0a122ee757b5da03c5335bba21e6be58fa2288d2585ecdfe76853", "ja": "JCC、楽しみにしてるね。\n美也とは、同じANGEL STARSだけど……。", "zh": "我很期待JCC哦。\n虽然和美也一样都是ANGEL STARS……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1059_003mik", "source_sha256": "0b588799c5b0768b5a48779fad8ad92a9ecc6ed59fcf9cca8bfe94b3dd262241", "ja": "美也が正面から来たから。\nミキも、正々堂々でいくね！", "zh": "因为美也从正面迎了上来。美希也会堂堂正正地来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1060_042miy", "source_sha256": "505aab904bee05ce96b23c97fe2b5ba1588bf4971b1e1aea21f94dea03f19dc0", "ja": "小細工は無用、ということですな～。\nわかりました～。", "zh": "也就是不需要耍小聪明了呢～。\n我明白了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1061_042miy", "source_sha256": "181e9d7056cb935a3539211a6e9a69ec81519479b1288bccf4ef9392bd9641b8", "ja": "私も、まっすぐ大金星を狙っていきますよ～。\n美希ちゃん、よろしくお願いしますね～。", "zh": "我也会直奔大胜利努力的哦～美希，拜托你啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1062_003mik", "source_sha256": "99cfdf1da6c0c7ff658624e7925b241cfa2aec1b86b645fbfc9d2ce089b44cbe", "ja": "うん！　よろしくお願いしますなの。\nあはっ☆", "zh": "嗯！请多关照哦。\n啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1063_p", "source_sha256": "3dfa58d4b65c63b8a83eca635c1aeb77714542c6c1e0fead46c406fc98cc6b43", "ja": "（今回の事は、美也にとっても美希にとっても、\n刺激になったようだ）", "zh": "（这次的事情对美也和美希来说，似乎都成了刺激）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0386_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_03_1064_p", "source_sha256": "35384bb82775dc125ed7442e4def4cf9cc52415e3ae383d14d76f359553d6a06", "ja": "（正々堂々、ふたりの勝負……楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（堂堂正正地进行一场对决……真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
